{"seq":4,"slug":"documentation-and-knowledge","title":"文档与知识","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/developer-experience-engineering/documentation-and-knowledge","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"docs-as-code","title":"文档即代码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/developer-experience-engineering/documentation-and-knowledge/docs-as-code","wordCount":2825,"readingTime":12},{"seq":2,"slug":"self-service-platforms","title":"自助式平台","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/developer-experience-engineering/documentation-and-knowledge/self-service-platforms","wordCount":2888,"readingTime":12},{"seq":3,"slug":"reducing-cognitive-load","title":"降低认知负荷","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/developer-experience-engineering/documentation-and-knowledge/reducing-cognitive-load","wordCount":3353,"readingTime":14}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"文档与知识-简介\">文档与知识 简介</h1><p>工具再好，如果开发者<strong>不知道怎么用、找不到答案、什么都得去问人</strong>，体验依然很差。知识的可获取性是 DX 容易被忽视却至关重要的一环。本章讲清如何让知识流动：先是<strong>文档即代码</strong>（docs-as-code——把文档当代码一样版本化、评审、就近放，以及 README/onboarding 的高杠杆价值），然后是<strong>自助式平台</strong>（self-service——让开发者自己就能完成常见任务，消除「去问某人」这个瓶颈），最后是<strong>降低认知负荷</strong>（减少开发者要记在脑子里的上下文，用就近的文档、合理的默认、清晰的命名让系统更易理解）。让知识自助可得、让系统少需要记，是 DX 的隐形地基。</p>\n"}